  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LAND-at-scale Chad: Towards inclusive land governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on previous interventions, the consortium implementing this project has an understanding of the social structures, roles and rights of land governance and land tenure systems in Chad to develop and test, in a participatory way, methods to secure land rights in two pilot areas. It uses existing and consolidated partnerships with the government, to obtain solid institutional anchoring and to directly inform the ongoing land reform in Chad. This will be done in two pilot sites, linking to other ongoing infrastructural investments.</narrative>
  </description>
